  volume    =  35,
  number    =  5,
  pages     = "1713--1731",
  abstract  = "AbstractThis paper describes the development of a model framework
               for Forecasts of Hurricanes Using Large-Ensemble Outputs (FHLO).
               FHLO quantifies the forecast uncertainty of a tropical cyclone
               (TC) by generating probabilistic forecasts of track, intensity,
