  abstract      = "Modeling physical systems in a generative manner offers
                   several advantages, including the ability to handle partial
                   observations, generate diverse solutions, and address both
                   forward and inverse problems. Recently, diffusion models have
                   gained increasing attention in the modeling of physical
                   systems, particularly those governed by partial differential
